; MOB DENDEN JUS - original bounded, delayed-observation AI WIP.
; Static source only. No match or strength assertion. Standard 1v1 only.
; AI reads public enemy MoveType/StateType/projectile count and distance;
; never enemy Command, future state, input buffer or hidden hit resolution.
; vars40..49 are exclusive AI snapshot fields, listed in AI_INPUT_CONTRACT.md.
; Delayed observation cycle: promote PREVIOUS snapshot, then capture next.
; Dispatch cadence every6 GameTime ticks; counter maximum policy weight65%.
; Deterministic GameTime/ID modular tie-break is reproducible, not random seed.
; All body action admissions art-gated by var59; no placeholder animation use.
[Statedef -3]

[State -3, PUNCH_Y retire unused stage authorization]
type = VarSet
triggerall = !IsHelper
triggerall = var(18) != 0
trigger1 = StateNo != 3100 && StateNo != 3101 && StateNo != 3102
